# Change-class router (cumulative)

When you change files in this turn, **classify every touched path** — **no first-match-only**. Union all matching classes, **dedupe** rule filenames, then **read each** listed projection before implementing.

Implementation table and algorithm: `N78-Ops/tools/lib/N78ChangeClassRouter.ps1` (STATIC verifiers use the same logic).

