| UI | ui, Screen/Page, desktop, compose | `11-testing-quality.mdc`, `02-ui-input-save.mdc` |
| PERSISTENCE | backup, storage, database | `14-backup-upgrade-lifecycle.mdc`, `11-testing-quality.mdc` |
